# Deployed configuration.
#
# docker-entrypoint.sh copies this file over .env on every container start, so
# this — not the .env you edit locally — is what the deployed app runs against.
#
# The competition platform fills in this competitor's own MySQL credentials when
# the repository is created. Leave it empty rather than guessing: an empty value
# makes /api/db-check report "not configured", which is a far clearer signal than
# connecting to the wrong database.

DATABASE_URL=""
